    "schemaVersion": 1,
    "description": "<section class=\"hol-item-reference\"><p class=\"hol-automation-label\"><strong>Automation:</strong> Rules reference · resolve effects at the table</p><div class=\"hol-reference-flavor\"><p>A blade catches high against yours. You step inside it and sweep through the enemies whose tangled footing leaves them slow to turn.</p></div><h2>Rules</h2><dl class=\"hol-reference-details\"><div><dt>Action</dt><dd>Main Action</dd></div><div><dt>Attribute</dt><dd>Agility</dd></div><div><dt>Target / range / shape</dt><dd>One adjacent enemy and every other Slowed enemy adjacent to you.</dd></div><div><dt>Equipment / acquisition</dt><dd>Requires a melee weapon.</dd></div><div><dt>Type</dt><dd>Skill / Attack</dd></div></dl><div class=\"hol-reference-rules\"><p>Make an Agility melee attack. Each target takes:</p><dl class=\"hol-reference-outcomes\"><dt>Weak</dt><dd>3 physical damage.</dd><dt>Standard</dt><dd>4 physical damage.</dd><dt>Strong</dt><dd>6 physical damage.</dd></dl></div><p class=\"hol-reference-source\"><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/bruceamoser/heroes-of-legend/blob/25b80c9fe77d7baaec3f3a8a548c9663d0f39a30/design/cards/under-their-guard.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">design/cards/under-their-guard.md</a> at <code>25b80c9fe77d7baaec3f3a8a548c9663d0f39a30</code>.</p></section>",
